WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.734
Cedric Leighton is

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.635
a CNN military analyst and retired U.S.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.336
Air Force colonel.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.038
He joins us now from Washington.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.172
Good to see you, sir.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.141
Good to see you, too, John.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:08.508
Let's start

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.943
with that attack on Russian soil

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.611
now, according to Michael Colburn,

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.212
a researcher

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:13.646
with the investigative Web site

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:14.647
Bellingcat.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.416
The Russian volunteer corps,

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.117
led by a figure

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.184
well known to him

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.686
and those who follow the transnational

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.988
far right, Dennis Capuchin.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.123
Now, the Anti-Defamation

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:23.757
League says Dennis

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.959
Capuchin is a Russian neo-Nazi

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:26.960
who lived in Germany

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.894
for many years, has trained

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.195
young members of the far right

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.330
national Democratic Party

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.598
of Germany and others

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.266
who also have ties to the as obviously

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:34.501
in the assault brigades,

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:35.935
which is a Ukrainian extremist

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.537
far right group as well.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.072
So when Putin actually goes public,

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:39.539
he insists

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.775
the attack was carried out by neo-Nazis.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:42.609
There's an element of truth

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:43.309
of that statement

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.377
and what the Ukrainian military

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.046
may have nothing to do with this.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.180
This is a big problem.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:47.747
It's a major issue.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:48.481
They have to deal with

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.184
Yeah, it certainly is, John.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:51.785
And, you know,

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:53.286
when you look at

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.922
this gentleman's pedigree,

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.624
you notice that he's trained

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:58.391
the members

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.359
of the youth

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.295
wing of the NPD Party in Germany,

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.031
which is a successor to the Nazi Party.

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.134
So there are some

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.136
some real issues that the Ukrainians

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.671
have to be very careful with,

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.472
because in this war,

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:13.173
quite frankly,

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:14.240
images, everything,

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.643
and it becomes important

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.212
for them to be as clean as possible

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:22.248
and as, you know, show as many Democratic

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:24.551
tendencies as possible in order to fight

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:25.518
a war.

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:27.387
It is very important for them

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:30.657
to follow all the rules of armed conflict

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:31.991
to a Geneva Convention

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.194
and anything that smacks of them

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:35.428
not doing so.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.796
I can be very detrimental

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.932
to the Ukrainian cause Yeah.

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.233
And there are so many foreign fighters

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.768
who flock to Ukraine just for,

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:42.836
you know, the battle or whatever.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:44.804
That is an issue as well.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.171
But

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:46.573
this wheat obsession

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:47.807
that the Russians have right now

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.209
of capturing Buckwheat.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:50.610
It looks like it may be coming to an end

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.945
game here on Tuesday.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:52.579
An adviser

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.746
to the Ukrainian president signaled

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.782
what seems to be a change in tactics.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:56.583
He was talking to CNN.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:57.217
Here he is

00:01:58.785 --> 00:01:59.986
Our military is obviously going

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.422
to weigh of the options so far.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:03.456
You know,

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:04.824
they hope to help the city,

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:05.992
but if need be,

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.694
they will strategically pull back

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:08.895
because we're not going to sacrifice

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.530
all of our people just for nothing.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.064
So it will be

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.066
a strategic step by the military,

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:15.735
which is a bit of a shift

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:16.603
because there's always been

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:17.170
this will fight to

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.271
the end, will hold it to the end.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.606
But at the same time,

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:20.773
Ukraine is sending more troops

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:21.341
into the fight there.

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:22.675
So that seems like there's

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.576
a few things happening here

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.411
that could be all part of disinformation.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.613
The extra troops could be there

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.313
to defend the city.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.149
They could provide cover for a retreat

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:29.582
or they could be

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:30.884
part of a counter-offensive.

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:31.784
How do you see all of this

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:34.654
Yeah, I

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:35.522
think it's the most

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:37.757
strategic retreat at this point in time

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:40.126
because I don't see the Ukrainians having

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:42.228
all the logistics in place

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:43.830
for a counteroffensive

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.198
Of course, they could surprise us.

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:46.232
And, you know,

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.834
anything is possible in warfare.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.435
But at this point in time,

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:52.071
it looks like the best course of action

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:52.972
for the Ukraine

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.408
would be to mount a strategic retreat,

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:58.511
pull the forces back just enough

00:02:58.511 --> 00:02:59.979
so that they aren't

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.182
impacted by the encirclement moves

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:02.882
that the Russians

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.484
are actually executing

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:06.386
right now, a run off mode.

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:08.588
How does an early spring thaw fall

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:10.490
into all of this? How's that play to it?

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.391
Because what was frozen

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:12.358
territory or trade flows

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.027
and ground is now mud.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:15.862
Yeah, that's true.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:16.529
And in fact,

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.730
the winter in Ukraine

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.899
has generally been warmer

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.401
than it normally is.

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:23.403
So you're dealing with a lot of mud

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:26.606
more now than you would normally deal

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.775
with at point in time in the year.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.611
So there is that factor.

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:34.514
There is also the factor of

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:36.816
the troop fatigue that it is

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.851
a key issue for the Ukrainians

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.720
and also for the Russians to some extent.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:41.287
But the Russians

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.422
have much

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:44.524
greater manpower resources, John.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:46.359
That's what you're seeing here,

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:48.094
that they're bringing them to bear.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:48.494
You know, we're

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.230
coupled with the Wagner group

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.631
that is creating a real problem

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.900
for the Ukrainian defenders of just.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:54.534
Yeah.

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:55.501
Just very quickly,

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.703
you know, the Russians have a staggering

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:58.171
loss, is trying to take this city.

00:03:58.171 --> 00:03:58.871
At the end of the day,

00:03:58.871 --> 00:03:59.906
they win the battle but lose

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:00.907
the war because of this

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:02.976
Most certainly.

00:04:02.976 --> 00:04:03.543
And in fact,

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:04.377
this could very well

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:05.812
prove to be a Pyrrhic victory

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:07.380
for the Russians.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.415
They have staked so much on both mud

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.284
that I think

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.253
really putting too much into this

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.921
from a military standpoint.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.422
And it could very well result

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:17.857
in great losses for them.

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.459
And it could also put them

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:20.994
at a significant disadvantage

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:22.228
going forward.

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:22.895
Colonel, as always, say,

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:23.563
thank you so much.

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:24.831
Good to have you with us.

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:26.466
You bet, John. Any time.

